[statement]
A package installed for its `install_if` condition is removed when the
condition no longer holds, before what its condition names.

[repository]
P:a
V:1

P:docs
V:1

P:a-doc
V:1
i:a docs

[installed]
P:a
V:1

P:docs
V:1

P:a-doc
V:1
i:a docs

[world]
a
docs

[request]
!docs

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
remove a-doc 1
remove docs 1
